{
  "slug": "infynon-pkg",
  "name": "Infynon Pkg",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Universal package security manager — intercepts install commands across 14 ecosystems (npm, yarn, pnpm, bun, pip, uv, poetry, cargo, go, gem, composer, nuget, hex, pub), scans lock files for CVEs via OSV.dev, auto-fixes vulnerable dependencies, deep dependency auditing, and scheduled vulnerability monitoring with email alerts.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install infynon-pkg@claude-community` from `d4rkNinja/code-guardian`.\n\nClaude Code plugins for the INFYNON suite — package security, API flow testing, and shared coding memory.\n\nUniversal package security manager — intercepts install commands across 14 ecosystems (npm, yarn, pnpm, bun, pip, uv, poetry, cargo, go, gem, composer, nuget, hex, pub), scans lock files for CVEs via OSV.dev, auto-fixes vulnerable dependencies, deep dependency auditing, and scheduled vulnerability monitoring with email alerts.",
